          "def-operator-norm-on-a-finite-dimensional-inner-product-space"
        ],
        "justified_by": [],
        "statement": "There is no uniform leading-line perturbation bound tending to zero with absolute operator-norm perturbation alone when the underlying eigengap is allowed to vanish.",
        "strategy": "Use a two-by-two diagonal matrix with gap delta and an off-diagonal symmetric perturbation of norm delta/4, and compute the perturbed eigenvector exactly.",
