        "justified_by": [],
        "statement": "For identity covariance I2, the full leading PCA eigenspace is R2 and every unit vector (and its line) maximizes projected variance1. For diag(2,1), the leading eigenspace is the unique line span(e1), with unit representatives +/-e1.",
